.TH QUICK-SYSTEM-INFO-GUI 1 "2026-07-20" "MX Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
quick-system-info-gui \- display Quick System Info reports
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quick-system-info-gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B quick-system-info-gui
is a graphical interface for displaying Quick System Info reports based on inxi and MX Linux-specific information. Select a report from the list to display it, copy a report in forum-ready format, save selected reports to an archive, or save the displayed text to a file.
.PP
On systems using systemd as PID 1, the Journald tab provides filters for user or system logs, priority, boot, and service. System-level logs require root privileges.
.SH OPTIONS
This application has no application-specific command-line options. Qt's standard
.B --help
and
.B --version
options are available.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/doc/quick-system-info-gui
Installed HTML help, images, license, and changelog documentation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR inxi (1),
.BR journalctl (1)
.SH AUTHOR
MX Linux contributors.
